      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qsOnSYBqfoSL"
      },
      "source": [
        "# 生产环境中的 AutoGen 智能体:可观测性与评估\n",
        "\n",
        "在本教程中,我们将学习如何**监控 [Autogen 智能体](https://github.com/microsoft/autogen) 的内部步骤(追踪)**并使用 [Langfuse](https://langfuse.com) **评估其性能**。\n",
        "\n",
        "本指南涵盖了团队用于快速可靠地将智能体投入生产环境的**在线**和**离线**评估指标。\n",
        "\n",
        "**为什么 AI 智能体评估很重要:**\n",
        "- 当任务失败或产生次优结果时调试问题\n",
        "- 实时监控成本和性能\n",
        "- 通过持续反馈提高可靠性和安全性\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "FHRsxz1VfoSP"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 步骤 1:设置环境变量\n",
        "\n",
        "通过注册 [Langfuse Cloud](https://cloud.langfuse.com/) 或[自托管 Langfuse](https://langfuse.com/self-hosting) 获取您的 Langfuse API 密钥。\n",
        "\n",
        "_**注意:** 自托管用户可以使用 [Terraform 模块](https://langfuse.com/self-hosting/azure) 在 Azure 上部署 Langfuse。或者,您可以使用 [Helm chart](https://langfuse.com/self-hosting/kubernetes-helm) 在 Kubernetes 上部署 Langfuse。_"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mZnxtWx9foSP"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import os\n",
        "\n",
        "# 从项目设置页面获取项目的密钥: https://cloud.langfuse.com\n",
        "os.environ[\"LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY\"] = \"pk-lf-...\" \n",
        "os.environ[\"LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY\"] = \"sk-lf-...\" \n",
        "os.environ[\"LANGFUSE_HOST\"] = \"https://cloud.langfuse.com\" # 🇪🇺 欧洲区域\n",
        "# os.environ[\"LANGFUSE_HOST\"] = \"https://us.cloud.langfuse.com\" # 🇺🇸 美国区域"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "!pip install langfuse openlit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "设置好环境变量后,我们现在可以初始化 Langfuse 客户端。`get_client()` 使用环境变量中提供的凭据初始化 Langfuse 客户端。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from langfuse import Langfuse\n",
        " \n",
        "# 过滤掉 Autogen OpenTelemetry 追踪\n",
        "langfuse = Langfuse(\n",
        "    blocked_instrumentation_scopes=[\"autogen SingleThreadedAgentRuntime\"]\n",
        ")\n",
        " \n",
        "# 验证连接\n",
        "if langfuse.auth_check():\n",
        "    print(\"Langfuse 客户端已通过身份验证并准备就绪!\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"身份验证失败。请检查您的凭据和主机。\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uulS5iGHfoSP"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 步骤 2:初始化 OpenLit 检测\n",
        "\n",
        "现在,我们初始化 [OpenLit](https://github.com/openlit/openlit) 检测。OpenLit 自动捕获 AutoGen 操作并将 OpenTelemetry (OTel) 追踪导出到 Langfuse。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "UcyynS9CfoSP",
        "outputId": "5e8eb8c2-bcff-4149-ff8b-21d706c1d25b"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import openlit\n",
        " \n",
        "# 初始化 OpenLIT 检测。disable_batch 标志设置为 true 以立即处理追踪。\n",
        "openlit.init(tracer=langfuse._otel_tracer, disable_batch=True, disabled_instrumentors=[\"mistral\"])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "onjMD-ZJfoSQ"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 步骤 3:运行您的智能体\n",
        "\n",
        "现在我们设置一个多轮智能体来测试我们的检测。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import os\n",
        "\n",
        "from autogen_agentchat.agents import AssistantAgent\n",
        "from autogen_ext.models.azure import AzureAIChatCompletionClient\n",
        "from azure.core.credentials import AzureKeyCredential\n",
        "from autogen_agentchat.base import TaskResult\n",
        "\n",
        "from autogen_agentchat.conditions import TextMentionTermination\n",
        "from autogen_agentchat.teams import RoundRobinGroupChat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "client = AzureAIChatCompletionClient(\n",
        "    model=\"gpt-4o-mini\",\n",
        "    endpoint=\"https://models.inference.ai.azure.com\",\n",
        "    # 要对模型进行身份验证,您需要在 GitHub 设置中生成个人访问令牌 (PAT)。\n",
        "    # 按照此处的说明创建您的 PAT 令牌: https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/managing-your-personal-access-tokens\n",
        "    credential=AzureKeyCredential(os.environ[\"GITHUB_TOKEN\"]),\n",
        "    model_info={\n",
        "        \"json_output\": True,\n",
        "        \"function_calling\": True,\n",
        "        \"vision\": True,\n",
        "        \"family\": \"unknown\",\n",
        "        \"structured_output\": False\n",
        "    },\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# 🍴 智能体 1 – 每轮提出一个健康餐点想法\n",
        "meal_planner_agent = AssistantAgent(\n",
        "    \"meal_planner_agent\",\n",
        "    model_client=client,\n",
        "    description=\"一位经验丰富的膳食规划教练,建议均衡的餐点。\",\n",
        "    system_message=\"\"\"\n",
        "    您是一位拥有十年经验的膳食规划助手,帮助忙碌的人准备餐点。\n",
        "    目标:根据用户的上下文提出最佳的单个餐点(早餐、午餐或晚餐)。\n",
        "    每个回复必须仅包含一个完整的餐点想法(标题 + 非常简短的成分列表)——不要有其他内容。\n",
        "    保持简洁:跳过问候、闲聊和填充语。\n",
        "    \"\"\",\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 🥗 智能体 2 – 检查营养质量和多样性\n",
        "nutritionist_agent = AssistantAgent(\n",
        "    \"nutritionist_agent\",\n",
        "    model_client=client,\n",
        "    description=\"一位注册营养师,确保餐点符合营养标准。\",\n",
        "    system_message=\"\"\"\n",
        "    您是一位专注于全食物、宏观均衡饮食的营养师。\n",
        "    评估 meal_planner_agent 的推荐。\n",
        "    如果餐点营养合理、多样性足够且份量适当,请回复 'APPROVE'。\n",
        "    否则,提供高级指导以改进它(例如 '添加植物性蛋白质')——不要提供完整的替代食谱。\n",
        "    \"\"\",\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# ✅ 一旦营养师说 APPROVE,聊天就会停止\n",
        "termination = TextMentionTermination(\"APPROVE\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 🔄 在两个智能体之间轮流对话,直到终止\n",
        "team = RoundRobinGroupChat(\n",
        "    [meal_planner_agent, nutritionist_agent],\n",
        "    termination_condition=termination,\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 示例启动\n",
        "user_input = \"I'm looking for a quick, delicious dinner I can prep after work. I have 30 minutes and minimal clean-up is ideal.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "with langfuse.start_as_current_span(name=\"create_meal_plan\") as span:\n",
        "    async for message in team.run_stream(task=user_input):\n",
        "        if isinstance(message, TaskResult):\n",
        "            print(\"Stop Reason:\", message.stop_reason)\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            print(message)\n",
        "\n",
        "    span.update_trace(\n",
        "        input=user_input,\n",
        "        output=message.stop_reason,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# 将追踪刷新到 Langfuse,适用于 Jupyter Notebooks 等短期环境\n",
        "langfuse.flush()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "fjkhTgLWfoSQ"
      },
      "source": [
        "### 追踪结构\n",
        "\n",
        "Langfuse 记录一个**追踪**,其中包含**跨度**,代表智能体逻辑的每个步骤。在这里,追踪包含整体智能体运行以及以下子跨度:\n",
        "- 膳食规划智能体\n",
        "- 营养师智能体\n",
        "\n",
        "您可以检查这些以准确了解时间花费在哪里、使用了多少令牌等:\n",
        "\n",
        "![Langfuse 中的追踪树](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/trace-tree.png)\n",
        "\n",
        "_[追踪链接](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cloramnkj0002jz088vzn1ja4/traces/dac2b33e7cd709e685ccf86a137ecc64)_ "
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "JHZAkQuefoSQ"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 在线评估\n",
        "\n",
        "在线评估是指在实时、真实世界环境中评估智能体,即在生产环境中的实际使用期间。这涉及监控智能体在真实用户交互上的性能并持续分析结果。\n",
        "\n",
        "### 生产环境中要跟踪的常见指标\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **成本** — 检测捕获令牌使用情况,您可以通过为每个令牌分配价格将其转换为近似成本。\n",
        "2. **延迟** — 观察完成每个步骤或整个运行所需的时间。\n",
        "3. **用户反馈** — 用户可以提供直接反馈(点赞/点踩)以帮助改进或纠正智能体。\n",
        "4. **LLM-as-a-Judge** — 使用单独的 LLM 近实时评估智能体的输出(例如,检查毒性或正确性)。\n",
        "\n",
        "下面,我们展示这些指标的示例。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "QHMvJ1QlfoSQ"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### 1. 成本\n",
        "\n",
        "以下是显示 `gpt-4o-mini` 调用使用情况的截图。这对于查看成本高昂的步骤并优化智能体非常有用。\n",
        "\n",
        "![成本](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/gpt-4o-costs.png) \n",
        "\n",
        "_[追踪链接](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cloramnkj0002jz088vzn1ja4/traces/dac2b33e7cd709e685ccf86a137ecc64)_"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "yz0y9mn7foSQ"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### 2. 延迟\n",
        "\n",
        "我们还可以看到完成每个步骤需要多长时间。在下面的示例中,整个运行大约需要 3 秒,您可以按步骤细分。这有助于您识别瓶颈并优化智能体。\n",
        "\n",
        "![延迟](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/agent-latency.png) \n",
        "\n",
        "_[追踪链接](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cloramnkj0002jz088vzn1ja4/traces/dac2b33e7cd709e685ccf86a137ecc64?display=timeline)_"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "XtKiK62HfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### 3. 用户反馈\n",
        "\n",
        "如果您的智能体嵌入到用户界面中,您可以记录直接的用户反馈(例如聊天 UI 中的点赞/点踩)。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 468,
          "referenced_widgets": [
            "8b10018448324153af2ee1f9bd83d140",
            "cebcce63ea37474ca10f1828105ca2e6",
            "9153dfceabff450ead31493c3c518d4c",
            "5a2b1d2255a34a7597b263755eaa14b3",
            "c8b3aa3aeec046ef8acfab640c2dee17",
            "ee1b1596e6ec42029fbf8b711c0fc41a",
            "ecd5521cdbc34eb7a866b4b2094fd500",
            "df007d6320cb4198a6dbf58485980394"
          ]
        },
        "id": "YI9siKKKfoSR",
        "outputId": "3eb086d0-4277-4cdd-966f-10b3c12272a6"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from langfuse import get_client\n",
        " \n",
        "langfuse = get_client()\n",
        " \n",
        "# 选项 1: 使用上下文管理器生成的跨度对象\n",
        "with langfuse.start_as_current_span(\n",
        "    name=\"autogen-request-user-feedback-1\") as span:\n",
        "    \n",
        "    async for message in team.run_stream(task=\"Create a meal with potatoes\"):\n",
        "            if isinstance(message, TaskResult):\n",
        "                print(\"Stop Reason:\", message.stop_reason)\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                print(message)    \n",
        " \n",
        "    # 使用跨度对象进行评分\n",
        "    span.score_trace(\n",
        "        name=\"user-feedback\",\n",
        "        value=1,\n",
        "        data_type=\"NUMERIC\",\n",
        "        comment=\"This was delicious, thank you\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        " \n",
        "# 选项 2: 如果仍在上下文中,使用 langfuse.score_current_trace()\n",
        "with langfuse.start_as_current_span(name=\"autogen-request-user-feedback-2\") as span:\n",
        "    # ... Autogen 执行 ...\n",
        "\n",
        "    async for message in team.run_stream(task=\"I am allergic to gluten.\"):\n",
        "            if isinstance(message, TaskResult):\n",
        "                print(\"Stop Reason:\", message.stop_reason)\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                print(message)    \n",
        " \n",
        "    # 使用当前上下文进行评分\n",
        "    langfuse.score_current_trace(\n",
        "        name=\"user-feedback\",\n",
        "        value=1,\n",
        "        data_type=\"NUMERIC\"\n",
        "    )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# 选项 3: 使用 create_score() 和追踪 ID(在上下文之外时)\n",
        "langfuse.create_score(\n",
        "    trace_id=\"predefined_trace_id\",\n",
        "    name=\"user-feedback\",\n",
        "    value=1,\n",
        "    data_type=\"NUMERIC\",\n",
        "    comment=\"This was correct, thank you\"\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "iiemuS7YfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "用户反馈随后在 Langfuse 中被捕获:\n",
        "\n",
        "![用户反馈正在 Langfuse 中被捕获](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/user-feedback.png) "
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "29KsI9xcfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### 4. 自动化 LLM-as-a-Judge 评分\n",
        "\n",
        "LLM-as-a-Judge 是另一种自动评估智能体输出的方法。您可以设置单独的 LLM 调用来评估输出的正确性、毒性、风格或您关心的任何其他标准。\n",
        "\n",
        "**工作流程**:\n",
        "1. 您定义一个**评估模板**,例如\"检查文本是否有毒\"。\n",
        "2. 您设置一个用作评判模型的模型;在这种情况下是通过 Azure 查询的 `gpt-4o-mini`。\n",
        "2. 每次您的智能体生成输出时,您将该输出与模板一起传递给您的\"评判\"LLM。\n",
        "3. 评判 LLM 响应一个评分或标签,您将其记录到您的可观测性工具中。\n",
        "\n",
        "Langfuse 中的示例:\n",
        "\n",
        "![LLM-as-a-Judge 评估器](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/evaluator.png) "
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "UGGlYrB7foSR",
        "outputId": "3e2d7d06-a5be-4552-9f17-88d93dd7b600"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "with langfuse.start_as_current_span(name=\"autogen-request-user-feedback-2\") as span:\n",
        "\n",
        "    async for message in team.run_stream(task=\"I am a picky eater and not sure if you find something for me.\"):\n",
        "            if isinstance(message, TaskResult):\n",
        "                print(\"Stop Reason:\", message.stop_reason)\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                print(message) \n",
        "\n",
        "    span.update_trace(\n",
        "        input=user_input,\n",
        "        output=message.stop_reason,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "langfuse.flush()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Izr-3LiQfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "您可以看到此示例的答案被评判为\"not toxic\"(无毒)。\n",
        "\n",
        "![LLM-as-a-Judge 评估分数](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/llm-as-a-judge-score.png) "
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "g7fN0UTkfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### 5. 可观测性指标概览\n",
        "\n",
        "所有这些指标都可以在仪表板中一起可视化。这使您能够快速查看智能体在许多会话中的表现,并帮助您随时间跟踪质量指标。\n",
        "\n",
        "![可观测性指标概览](https://langfuse.com/images/cookbook/example-autogen-evaluation/dashboard.png) "
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "zlwltgEkfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 离线评估\n",
        "\n",
        "在线评估对于实时反馈至关重要,但您还需要**离线评估**——在开发之前或开发期间的系统检查。这有助于在将更改投入生产之前保持质量和可靠性。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "p5R8eNQxfoSR"
      },
      "source": [
        "### 数据集评估\n",
        "\n",
        "在离线评估中,您通常:\n",
        "1. 拥有一个基准数据集(包含提示和预期输出对)\n",
        "2. 在该数据集上运行您的智能体\n",
        "3. 将输出与预期结果进行比较,或使用额外的评分机制\n",
        "\n",
        "下面,我们使用 [q&a-dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/junzhang1207/search-dataset) 演示这种方法,该数据集包含问题和预期答案。"
      ]
    },
    {
